         picker. Each provider needs its own pair; without a label the picker
         falls back to the app name and lists three identical entries. -->
    <string name="prayer_widget_label_strip">مواقيت الصلاة</string>
    <string name="prayer_widget_desc_strip">شريط يعرض وقتاً واحداً مع العد التنازلي</string>

